# mod-custom-spells: the Rogue lines of the third concept list
# (operator 2026-10-31; share-public
# custom-spells/records/2026-10-31-third-concept-list.md), wave 2 = procs and
# stacking buffs (900606 Hunger for Blood: Bloody Contagion, 900643 Fan of
# Knives: Serrated Blades with its bleeds 900644 / 900645). Every check states
# the list's line, so a FAIL marks a defect.
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena - eight AoE Training Dummies
# (920018) on a 4-yd circle around (-270, 150); d1 = the west-most one. The
# bot stands west of the ring, the Fan of Knives in the ring's middle (it hits
# every enemy round the rogue).
# Gear: Worn Shortsword 25 and Skeleton's Sword 36528 are one-hand swords (item
# class 2, subclass 7), the Dirk 2139 a dagger; Dual Wield 674 and the sword
# proficiency 201 are taught first. The equip order puts the first sword in the
# main hand and the second in the off hand once both hands are empty (destroyed
# first: every copy in the bags and on the body goes).
# Hit rolls: Song of Sylvanas 59756 (no miss) and NPC Hit Buffs 62627 (no dodge
# or parry) on the rogue.
# Kills: Young Black Bears (1128, level 5, hostile, beasts: no poison immunity)
# the director spawns on its own spot (.npc add temp: they despawn once dead).
# The Deadly Poison IX DoT 57970 (a poison: a tick of 74 and more every 3 s,
# 12 s) kills one by itself within a few ticks, the rogue's own kill, so the
# Hunger for Blood proc runs.
# Spells: Fan of Knives 51723 (its off-hand part 52874), Deadly Poison IX DoT
# 57970, Hunger for Blood self buff 63848 (a GM aura: the cast, 51662, has none).
name    Custom spells - Rogue third list
timeout 300s

bot ro rogue slot=4

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require ro alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near ro
require d1 exists
do gm target ro
as gm .unlearn 900606
as gm .unlearn 900643
as gm .unaura 63848
do ro learn 51723
do ro learn 674
do ro learn 201
do ro destroy 2139
do ro destroy 50055
do ro destroy 25
do ro destroy 36528
as gm .additem 25
as gm .additem 36528
do ro equip 25
do ro equip 36528
require ro worn 25
require ro worn 36528
as gm .aura 59756
as gm .aura 62627
waitfor ro aura 62627 timeout 2s

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Combat
log Combat - control for 900643: with two one-hand swords but without the passive a Fan of Knives (ring's middle, every dummy round the rogue) makes nobody bleed
do ro goto -270 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
spelllog start
do ro cast 51723 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect ro spell 51723 casts >= 1
expect ro spell 900644 casts == 0
expect ro spell 900645 casts == 0

log Combat - 900643 "fan of knifes does +100% bonus bleed when using 2 1h swords": with the passive and a one-hand sword in each hand every hit of the Fan of Knives (main hand 51723 and off hand 52874) makes its enemy bleed (900644 / 900645, 3 ticks over 6 s)
do ro learn 900643
do ro reset
wait 300ms
spelllog start
do ro cast 51723 triggered
wait 7s
spelllog stop
expect ro spell 51723 casts >= 1
expect ro spell 900644 casts >= 5
expect ro spell 900645 casts >= 5
expect ro spell 900644 ticks >= 12
expect ro spell 900645 ticks >= 12

log Combat - 900643 with the sword in the off hand gone (a dagger or nothing there) the Fan of Knives does not bleed anybody: only two swords count
do ro destroy 36528
wait 7s
spelllog start
do ro cast 51723 triggered
wait 1s
spelllog stop
expect ro spell 51723 casts >= 1
expect ro spell 900644 casts == 0
expect ro spell 900645 casts == 0
as gm .unlearn 900643

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Assassination
log Assassination - control for 900606: Hunger for Blood active, two bears side by side, the poison kills the first one - without the passive the second one takes no poison
do ro goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
as gm .aura 63848
waitfor ro aura 63848 timeout 2s
as gm .npc add temp 1128
as gm .npc add temp 1128
wait 500ms
pick bearA creature:1128 near gm
pick bearB creature:1128 near gm fresh
require bearA exists
require bearB exists
do ro approach bearA
wait 300ms
do ro cast 57970 on bearA triggered
waitfor bearA missing timeout 14s
expect bearB noaura 57970
do ro approach bearB
wait 300ms
do ro cast 57970 on bearB triggered
waitfor bearB missing timeout 14s

log Assassination - 900606 "if you kill the target affected by hunger for blood, it jumps to the next enemy with 50% increased effect": two bears with the passive - when the poison kills the first one the Deadly Poison jumps to the second (within 10 yd) with +50 % damage, which dies of it too; a third bear 40 yd away gets nothing
do ro learn 900606
as gm .aura 63848
waitfor ro aura 63848 timeout 2s
as gm .npc add temp 1128
as gm .npc add temp 1128
wait 500ms
pick bearA creature:1128 near gm
pick bearB creature:1128 near gm fresh
require bearA exists
require bearB exists
do gm goto -279 190 -423.2
wait 500ms
as gm .npc add temp 1128
wait 500ms
pick bearC creature:1128 near gm fresh
require bearC exists
do gm goto -279 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do ro approach bearA
wait 300ms
spelllog start
do ro cast 57970 on bearA triggered
waitfor bearB aura 57970 timeout 14s
expect bearB aura 57970
waitfor bearA missing timeout 3s
waitfor bearB missing timeout 14s
spelllog stop
expect ro spell 57970 ticks >= 3
expect bearC noaura 57970
do ro approach bearC
wait 300ms
do ro cast 57970 on bearC triggered
waitfor bearC missing timeout 14s

cleanup
do ro stop
do gm target ro
as gm .unaura 63848
as gm .unaura 59756
as gm .unaura 62627
as gm .unlearn 900606
as gm .unlearn 900643
do ro destroy 25
do ro destroy 36528
as gm .additem 2139
do ro equip 2139
